                <mxCell id="oci-compat-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Compatibility to verify&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Object Storage: configure the S3-compatible endpoint and customer secret keys; test S3Store file operations. Repo uses PostgreSQL 18; OCI documentation lists 14–17. Validate managed-service compatibility or self-manage PG18. Enable and verify pgvector." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#253A36;text;align=left;fontSize=17;" parent="1" vertex="1">
